              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOur hero section sets the tone for the Nubis experience. By combining a block grid headline with a reusable rich text narrative, I can iterate on messaging without refactoring markup. The frosted glass backdrop is handled in CSS, letting authors stay focused on storytelling.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ee7c40a1-e56c-4eb1-a670-fe3202f7f382",
